{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 44, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to the Land of the Rising Sun! A journey grand awaits thee I shall weave a tale of days and nights a schedule fit for a king or queen.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a City of Light**\n\nThou arrivest in Tokyo a sprawling realm of neon glow. The Narita Express doth whisk thee hence to thy lodging a haven of comfort. Explore Shinjuku's heights a vista vast and bold. Dine upon ramen a broth of savory delight a story in each slurp.\n\n**Day Two: Ancient Echoes and Modern Marvels**\n\nVisit the Imperial Palace a seat of power long past. Then wander through the gardens serene a respite from the city's clamor.  Explore the vibrant Shibuya crossing a human tide a spectacle to behold.  Seek solace in the Meiji Jingu Shrine a place of peace and reverence.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Embrace**\n\nJourney to Hakone a mountain town of art and grace. Cruise upon Lake Ashi a mirror reflecting Mount Fuji's majestic face.  Ascend the Hakone Ropeway a thrilling ride amidst volcanic vistas.  Immerse thyself in an onsen a hot spring bath a balm for weary bones.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Charm a City of Old**\n\nTake passage to Kyoto a city steeped in history and tradition.  Explore Fushimi Inari Shrine a pathway of vermillion gates a sight to charm the soul.  Marvel at Kinkaku-ji the Golden Pavilion a temple shimmering in the sun's embrace.  Wander through Gion a district of geishas a glimpse into a bygone era.\n\n**Day Five: Bamboo Forests and Zen Gardens**\n\nFind tranquility in Arashiyama's bamboo grove a forest of towering stalks.  Visit Tenryu-ji Temple a Zen garden a masterpiece of minimalist design.  Enjoy a traditional tea ceremony a ritual of grace and serenity.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji Temple**\n\nJourney to Nara a city of friendly deer roaming free.  Visit Todai-ji Temple home to a giant bronze Buddha a testament to faith.  Explore Kasuga Taisha Shrine a sanctuary adorned with thousands of lanterns.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure a Farewell to Japan**\n\nBid farewell to Japan a land of wonder and enchantment.  Return to Tokyo or depart for home with memories to cherish a tapestry of experiences woven with care.  May thy journey be blessed and thy heart forever touched by the beauty of the East.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0029929152224212885}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3351351299206726e-05}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -1.0791597366333008}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.011780809611082077}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.846026599407196}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.3768494725227356}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.003650312777608633}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -8.391981828026474e-05}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.47293204069137573}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.28579267859458923}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.16127003729343414}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.9360815286636353}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.06736787408590317}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.2219061553478241}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -1.8487519025802612}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.00135389668866992}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.2075299471616745}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.003727038623765111}, {"token": "▁tale", "logprob": -0.13271886110305786}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.0017527469899505377}, {"token": "▁days", "logprob": -0.0024943212047219276}, {"token": "▁and", "logprob": -0.08241007477045059}, {"token": "▁nights", "logprob": -0.00017772526189219207}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.09755585342645645}, {"token": "▁schedule", "logprob": -1.2648723125457764}, {"token": "▁fit", "logprob": -0.947306215763092}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -6.151010165922344e-05}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.17188991606235504}, {"token": "▁king